<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classHdtnCliRunner" kindref="compound">HdtnCliRunner</ref> class is used for launching HDTN CLI utility. The <ref refid="classHdtnCliRunner" kindref="compound">HdtnCliRunner</ref> connects to a running HDTN application over a ZMQ socket and issues API commands using the REQ/REP pattern. </para>
</sect1>
